571
00:49:54.200 --> 00:49:55.827
Fifty-two million yea rs.

572
00:49:57.328 --> 00:49:59.080
“Every hundred years.

573
00:49:59.163 --> 00:50:00.790
"a little bird comes.

574
00:50:02.166 --> 00:50:05.136
